{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "96c7670c-8fc0-8ada-a5b9-072a581adfb9",
  "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:03:53-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ivan Andrade",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:01:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:01:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. Pardon me, is this the right department for a recycling pickup problem?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:01:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:01:33-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, my recycling bin was left at the curb this morning with a tag on it. It says rejected. Pardon me, I don't know what it was rejected for."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:01:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Did the tag give a reason? Usually there's a box checked or a note written on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:01:53-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a checkbox, I think it's the one about contamination. But I rinsed everything. Pardon me, it's hard to read, the ink ran a little."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:02:03-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that happens with the damp. Was there anything in there like plastic bags, or food containers that weren't clean, or maybe items in a bag?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:02:14-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Possibly a couple of things in a plastic bag. I put the cans in a bag so they wouldn't blow around. Is that a problem?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:02:24-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That could be it. Recycling needs to go in loose, not bagged. The crews can't see inside the bag so they reject the whole bin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:02:34-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. Pardon me, that's useful. And this is the second miss in a row, so the bin has been sitting full for two weeks now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:02:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:02:48-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "181 Ocean Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:02:50-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 181 Ocean Avenue. So here's what I'd do. Take everything out of the bags, empty it loose into the bin, and put it out for your next regular pickup. Don't go putting the bags in the bin either, those go in the trash."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:03:07-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. Pardon me, one more thing. Does the tag get removed, or should I leave it on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:03:15-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can take it off. The crew will see it's been fixed on the next route. If it gets rejected again, call me back and I'll note it for the supervisor."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:03:28-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Oh, and a small thing, my savings account paid a little interest this quarter, so I suppose something went right this week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:03:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's something. Anything else I can help with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:03:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Pardon me, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:03:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Andrade. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:03:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
